msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:182 2dda7f1806fc4a5eb15cbbc4e02c9f59
#: 30c7f1eb7ec94cc198ef2894d10b0d69 62b9e414371a4ff293ef729059cae33a
#: 6565a7624272440080a51ea7c7c6273f 8ef3dac7a8d648d0820be51a5ea50ab3
#: e0a8a9f60d304b41a1a6bc1db9a531c7
msgid ""
"The RADIX 2 HD uses a proprietary bootloader which needs a firmware file in "
"a custom file format. There are several ways of obtaining the firmware file,"
" as explained below. Once you have obtained the file, copy it to the USB "
"drive that appears when connecting the RADIX 2 HD to your computer when it "
"is in bootloader mode (hold the BOOT button and release when connecting to "
"USB). Once it finishes copying, safely remove the drive. At this point the "
"RADIX 2 HD will reboot and run the ArduPilot firmware."
msgstr ""
"RADIX 2 HD 使用专有引导程序，需要特定文件格式的固件文件。获取固件文件有多种方法，详见下文。获取文件后，在将 RADIX 2 HD "
"以引导程序模式（按住 BOOT 按钮并在连接 USB 时松开）连接到计算机时出现的 USB 驱动器中复制该文件。复制完成后，安全弹出驱动器。此时 "
"RADIX 2 HD 将重启并运行 ArduPilot 固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:184 26ff3d8d5d4c4a0f8ec1f76a5fcc3b5d
#: 386cc869859d46a4ad0de1d6d4234300 7695dbcce2da4ad09428d69a4fa08aaa
#: 7fe7c4d1d97e4c12b02779c04a558112 b305d7fc1b8344f9a1f3822843c01f9e
#: e0aaf0408a2a4627a4c3cdde8edea895
msgid ""
"When using ArduPilot, it is necessary to have a microSD card inserted, "
"without it the firmware won't run."
msgstr "使用 ArduPilot 时，必须插入 MicroSD 卡，否则固件无法运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:187 4ef1cc13fa9a48ca98a12208a7279f77
#: 683b8e5dd7424ec89199a95a81b23876 a86425b6f2c244f4aa358969a371507e
#: b371dd62a949403c968b3f1282d1ca8d e2d9aa9d614f4a438d6d02aafc6ab031
#: efa628e2c18d423b9ece51e5f0b442e8
msgid "Option 1: Download the Firmware File the BrainFPV Website"
msgstr "方法 1：从 BrainFPV 网站下载固件文件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:189 232858b38faa4bd080a2a20347019734
#: 8f22cbaa76454382af971e5b8bf77454 9462c1fbb2ac4515a32f1687bd8cb749
#: 9dfd9e57a82f4c2d8b882661cf6423b7 a8927749b6bf4a1b96bb1a5ebac73e26
#: fca7e9d1aa7b436ebcaa3386c5fd0436
msgid ""
"The easiest way to get firmware files for your RADIX 2 HD is to download "
"them from the BrainFPV website. You can do so `here "
"<https://www.brainfpv.com/firmware/>`__."
msgstr ""
"获取 RADIX 2 HD 固件文件的最简便方法是从 BrainFPV 网站下载。可在 `此处 "
"<https://www.brainfpv.com/firmware/>`__ 下载。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:192 10400a27174f45ec9f42a5bf855c44d7
#: 4c63091c41084850821f6cca164a1fc4 6c579b1ddbfb42cb9414967a74d31b8a
#: 789bf05bb2a841e99cc5915d52b5c3f7 911aea03bd3142c5bdd508619dc9dbd6
#: 9fd487ac81d14925ae081b49256cb9f9
msgid "Option 2: Download the Firmware From the ArduPilot Firmware Server"
msgstr "方法 2：从 ArduPilot 固件服务器下载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:194 0bb4c9dc32bc46b99a99b6a3d2dcb478
#: 29e692edf1a744f886fe60f4572e50e0 6ff667054af04407872b571b3d49540c
#: c6b05c93322643db9321f58550e3abe6 c909b2fe2c1340238b55054846d55b99
#: d36bd6fa3a004e15a26de5a8329bd232
msgid ""
"Download the ELF file from the `ArduPilot Firmware Server "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__. Make sure you download the file for the"
" \"RADIX2HD\" target. For example, the ELF file for ArduCopter is called "
"\"arducopter.elf\". At this time, only the 4.5 (\"latest\") versions are "
"available."
msgstr ""
"从 `ArduPilot 固件服务器 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ 下载 ELF "
"文件。请确保下载「RADIX2HD」目标的文件。例如，ArduCopter 的 ELF 文件名为「arducopter.elf」。目前仅提供 "
"4.5（「latest」）版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:196 542f39e4d14d45adaedf2bf336895e73
#: 6a50c7089c1545eb897b09084f51ac3b 9937edfd242b45ce9d1c706c9c850cb5
#: dc84553dd53647eb8a73c161a03babf1 e7e16d9af8824111a3b6b7d42632dfde
#: fcfa2f8233d7465b8ee3f384712269ac
msgid ""
"In order to use the ELF file with your RADIX 2 HD, it needs to be converted "
"using the BrainFPV Firmware Packer. This utility is implemented in Python, "
"so you will need a Python installation."
msgstr ""
"要将 ELF 文件用于 RADIX 2 HD，需要使用 BrainFPV 固件打包工具进行转换。此工具基于 Python 实现，因此需要安装 "
"Python。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:198 05e4e278c7804a8db301cd0d8248b2fb
#: 18426f9e28d847b28aa1c9976df2dd7c 48ffade0bab24673b85df614a1251ba3
#: 99444cb9744041689abb188066ab65ba c59655c3c4354006b931aa15734174d3
#: de0a79cda225415bab8def8ec98eedb0
msgid ""
"If you are using Linux, use your package manager to install Python 3. If you"
" are using Windows, download the Python 3 installer from the Python Website "
"and run it. When installing, make sure to select \"Add Python to PATH\", so "
"you will be able to use Python from the Windows Command Prompt."
msgstr ""
"如果您使用 Linux，请通过包管理器安装 Python 3。如果使用 Windows，请从 Python 官网下载 Python 3 "
"安装程序并运行。安装时，务必选择「Add Python to PATH」，以便在 Windows 命令提示符中使用 Python。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:200 18020fe574314b7cb530c113943ee55f
#: 5e92d85f6eb14f94b3dab622014ae9d4 63413a4a522b41fa9d1256de8c2500cd
#: 79646f0ab36a40cea4922315afa54b9f a084ae7f05834e7d84e1c2afe6548d25
#: d6f339d725be49a5aae8ef8c5189fd6a
msgid ""
"After installing Python, start the Command Prompt and install the BrainFPV "
"Firmware Packer using the following command:"
msgstr "安装 Python 后，启动命令提示符，使用以下命令安装 BrainFPV 固件打包工具："

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:207 3f74be13b9ca48749aabab47d544849a
#: 4f863b41ef1b4b0089a479d9e5dbdebc 7a2cb05d120c4e6d80169562c7a3f76e
#: 80997fb9276742fe8b7d57f619f88149 bb2ef19bea4a4905bddb7a4855213972
#: df7dfe1cf34b40418c7b474ef49d69ad
msgid ""
"After installing it, you can use the following command to convert the "
"\"arducopter.elf\" (or other vehicle elf file) file to a \"arducopter.bin\" "
"file that can be used with the RADIX 2 HD:"
msgstr ""
"安装后，可使用以下命令将「arducopter.elf」（或其他飞行器 elf 文件）转换为可用于 RADIX 2 HD "
"的「arducopter.bin」文件："

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:215 052e0dd3705c429787f283bcfe832bc5
#: 165152f2da504f3e93b26a1bf1009e12 1c031cab5bb04daf8199ba360775eb6a
#: 21dbf3bfb60b46d193c08cc6285569d8 3b80555b7ad949b0865013783a31df62
#: b95f41309d0c478a857cdc5dac135932
msgid "Option 3: Compile the Firmware Yourself"
msgstr "方法 3：自行编译固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:217 0d3306e1b6864828ab839dcb0508813e
#: 2797ff3504224a458a807d43d5e367e4 49f81d86d33e4ebd8da2ce877592e86c
#: 7fd3f5f5d8db4a6888f92be1c6a482f8 da5a09bf1d974097ab4df38228964093
#: db27a635e1fd4d11a8ede8babd8bc276
msgid ""
"If you have a working :ref:`ArduPilot build environment<building-the-code>`,"
" you can compile the firmware yourself and then convert it to the format "
"needed by the BrainFPV bootloader. You will also need the BrainFPV Firmware "
"Packer to do so. Install it using the \"pip install\" command shown above."
msgstr ""
"如果您有可用的 :ref:`ArduPilot 构建环境<building-the-code>`，可以自行编译固件，然后将其转换为 BrainFPV "
"引导程序所需的格式。您还需要 BrainFPV 固件打包工具。使用上述「pip install」命令安装。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:219 0477aaf9f50b45979c61cf3cd0f2363e
#: 26752ba7f9da4e9bb1eb81ec4fbd5158 2867893c0fba4fbead1c162a89d1db3c
#: 344fc4db9232424494bb9fba2282d8f7 53722ed95c9241e688353f07b9825856
#: eda46e08ef2e47b5a9020c94b89674ec
msgid "For Copter, build the firmware as follows:"
msgstr "对于 Copter，按如下方式构建固件："

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:226 165d2fcc82494a6daa1a608b5e9541f3
#: 1845ef33d80c42f9b5e10afe2c9863f5 65356c3c49864d8e9e022589fa63e30e
#: 853e8c9e86bb4c5794d2aead4e0eacc0 90383f798f3f4b6dbbc594850a3488f4
#: ecaca6e5674749d0bb6377c9ee53919b
msgid ""
"other vehicles can be built, but the RADIX2HD is targeted primarily for "
"copter applications. Then use the firmware packer script to create the "
"firmware file that can be used with the BrainFPV bootloader:"
msgstr "也可以构建其他飞行器固件，但 RADIX2HD 主要针对多旋翼应用。然后使用固件打包脚本创建可用于 BrainFPV 引导程序的固件文件："

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:232 22d6cea982c04fd6b5a3942bef2841fc
#: 6bd7a00948af42da8d412276d4198183 80048ac3d0f7465fbffc0d5f518891df
#: a81b4801c1ff43f089aad65fbe1b4c22 d7ba7069a6e44c60ae02a407ac78ea1c
#: ee8d9a959af34c8ea0cbb975f84135a0
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"To use it, copy the resulting arducopter_{VERSION}_brainfpv.bin to the USB "
"drive that appears when the RADIX 2 HD is in bootloader mode."
msgstr ""
"使用时，将生成的 arducopter_{VERSION}_brainfpv.bin 复制到 RADIX 2 HD 处于引导程序模式时出现的 USB "
"驱动器中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:119 0474eb8e8c6d4569a63aefdc3d150a06
#: 20974abb9964437c94bc4e17ac885a3d 2f9bdca749aa42b196efeded7deab7f8
#: 6850f91da84c44b1acd01bc770983303 dee5f0366c0e4d0c8af1365be0dd6a7d
msgid ""
"The RADIX 2 HD has a total of 10 PWM outputs. All support PWM and DShot. The"
" first 8 outputs also support BDSHOT and are on the two 4-in-1 ESC "
"connectors. The PWM outputs are in groups of 2 channels each, all channels "
"in the same group need to use the same configuration / rate."
msgstr ""
"RADIX 2 HD 共有 10 路 PWM 输出。全部支持 PWM 和 DShot。前 8 路输出还支持 BDSHOT，位于两个 4 合 1 "
"电调连接器上。PWM 输出按每组 2 个通道分组，同一组中的所有通道必须使用相同的配置/速率。"
